---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base current="contact" lang="fr" title="Contact — FrenchSaaS" description="Parlez-moi de votre produit et recevez un périmètre clair et un devis pour votre localisation française.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <span class="deco deco-guillemets" data-parallax="0.18" aria-hidden="true">«&nbsp;»</span>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stagger"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span></div>
      <h1 class="display-xl stagger">Parlons-en<span class="guillemet">.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede stagger">Parlez-moi de votre produit, de vos délais et du volume approximatif de mots ou de chaînes. Je reviens vers vous avec un périmètre clair et un devis.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap contact-grid">

      <form class="contact-form reveal" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" action="/fr/merci/">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
        <p style="display:none;">
          <label>Ne pas remplir : <input name="bot-field" /></label>
        </p>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="name">Nom</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="email">Email professionnel</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="company">Entreprise / produit</label>
          <input type="text" id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="message">Votre projet</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required placeholder="Que localisez-vous, pour quand, et quel volume environ ?"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div>
          <button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit">Envoyer</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <aside class="contact-aside reveal" style="--d:0.1s;">
        <span class="eyebrow">En direct</span>
        <p class="big-mail"><a href="mailto:contact@dorineparmentier.com">contact@dorineparmentier.com</a></p>
        <p class="availability"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Je réponds à toute demande sérieuse sous un jour ouvré, en français ou en anglais.</p>
        <p class="tz">Basée en France <strong>(CET)</strong> — un fuseau qui recouvre les matinées américaines et les soirées asiatiques.</p>

        <!-- Carte LinkedIn -->
        <a class="li-card" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dorine-parmentier" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="li-photo">
            <img src="/images/dorine.jpg" alt="Dorine Parmentier" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentNode.classList.add('li-photo-fallback');" />
            <span class="li-initials" aria-hidden="true">DP</span>
          </span>
          <span class="li-body">
            <span class="li-name">Dorine Parmentier</span>
            <span class="li-role">Language Lead · Localisation EN→FR</span>
            <span class="li-cta">Me suivre sur LinkedIn <span class="li-arrow">→</span></span>
          </span>
          <span class="li-badge" aria-hidden="true">in</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Invitation Tradiscord, ton "collègues" -->
        <a class="community-card" href="https://tradiscord.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="community-head">
            <span class="community-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            <span class="community-title">Vous êtes traducteur·rice ?</span>
          </span>
          <span class="community-desc">Rejoignez <strong>Tradiscord</strong>, l'une des plus grandes communautés francophones de traducteurs — 1 500+ collègues qui échangent entraide, bons plans, retours d'expérience et discussions de métier. C'est moi qui l'anime, venez dire bonjour !</span>
          <span class="community-cta">Rejoindre la communauté <span class="li-arrow">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .availability { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .status-dot {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 8px; height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #2FBF71;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(47, 191, 113, 0.5);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    animation: pulse 2.4s ease-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(47, 191, 113, 0.5); }
    70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(47, 191, 113, 0); }
    100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(47, 191, 113, 0); }
  }
  .tz { font-size: 0.95rem; }

  /* Carte LinkedIn */
  .li-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #fff;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }
  .li-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 3px;
    background: var(--purple);
    transform: scaleY(0);
    transform-origin: top;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .li-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(83, 74, 183, 0.16);
    border-color: var(--purple);
  }
  .li-card:hover::before { transform: scaleY(1); }

  .li-photo {
    flex: 0 0 60px;
    width: 60px; height: 60px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--purple), var(--purple-deep));
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--tint);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .li-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .li-initials {
    position: absolute; z-index: 1;
    font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.4rem; color: #fff;
  }
  .li-photo-fallback img { display: none; }

  .li-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem; flex: 1; }
  .li-name { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .li-role { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--grey); }
  .li-cta {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--purple);
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }
  .li-arrow { display: inline-block; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
  .li-card:hover .li-arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }

  .li-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.9rem; right: 1rem;
    width: 22px; height: 22px;
    background: #0A66C2;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  /* Carte communauté Tradiscord */
  .community-card {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem;
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--tint), #fff);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    text-decoration: none;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }
  .community-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(83, 74, 183, 0.16);
    border-color: var(--purple);
  }
  .community-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .community-icon {
    color: var(--purple); font-size: 1.1rem;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }
  .community-card:hover .community-icon { transform: rotate(180deg) scale(1.2); }
  .community-title { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .community-desc { display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--grey); line-height: 1.6; }
  .community-desc strong { color: var(--purple); font-weight: 600; }
  .community-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--purple);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .status-dot { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
